## Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes

Each entry in `identity_profiles` is populated by the same conversion code as
the singular [`identitynow_identity_profile_v1` data source](../data-sources/identity_profile_v1.md) -
see its "Known Limitations & Live Testing Notes" section for the full list
of limitations shared by both.

`GET /identity-profiles/v1`'s documented maximum `limit` is 250; requested
limits above that are capped with a warning rather than an error.
